<title>MALAYSIA: Ringgit recovers vs dollar, seen rangebound.</title>
<headline>Ringgit recovers vs dollar, seen rangebound.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Previous	Forecast	Resistance    Support</p>
<p>2.5145/90     2.5140/70     2.5120	  2.5200</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>* Ringgit recovers after dollar sell orders at 2.5190</p>
<p>* Profit-taking and offshore demand limiting dollar downside at 2.5145</p>
<p>* Dollar/ringgit seen rangebound on lack of fresh factors</p>
<p>The ringgit recovered against the dollar but profit-taking and offshore demand for the dollar limited its upside, dealers said.</p>
</text>
